@startuml
title SLE-3 Level 4 - Linear Search Code Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Linear Search Engine" {

    rectangle "linear_search(arr, target)" as Search

    rectangle "initialize_index()" as Init

    rectangle "compare_element(arr[i], target)" as Compare

    rectangle "move_to_next_index(i)" as Next

    rectangle "return_result(index)" as Result
}

Search --> Init : Start search
Init --> Compare : Index i

Compare --> Result : Target found
Compare --> Next : Target not found

Next --> Compare : Next index

@enduml